# Stagecoach Security: "When this creature enters, creatures you control get +1/+1 and gain vigilance until end of turn." Bot1 has an Ornithopter; Bot2 has a Memnite.
# On turn 3 Bot1 hard-casts Security off five Moxen: it, the Ornithopter and nothing of Bot2's get +1/+1 and vigilance (the opponent's Memnite stays 1/1, CR 611.2c),
# and a Memnite Bot1 casts afterwards is not affected (the set of creatures was fixed as the ability resolved). On turn 4 the effect is gone.

